### Auth
- `POST /api/auth/register` - Create admin account
- `POST /api/auth/login` - Login

### Matches
- `GET /api/matches` - Get all matches
- `GET /api/matches/:id` - Get match details
- `GET /api/matches/:id/appearances` - Get player stats for match
- `POST /api/matches` - Create match (admin)
- `PUT /api/matches/:id` - Update match (admin)
- `POST /api/matches/:id/appearances` - Save appearances (admin)

### Players
- `GET /api/players` - Get all active players
- `GET /api/players/stats` - Get season statistics
- `POST /api/players` - Add player (admin)
- `PUT /api/players/:id` - Update player (admin)

### Calendar
- `POST /api/calendar/sync` - Sync Google Calendar
- `GET /api/calendar/events` - Get calendar events
- `PUT /api/calendar/:eventId/mark-as-match` - Toggle event as match

## Development Notes

